WEBVTT

00:27:26.954 --> 00:27:32.413
I also think in my case, there was
this sort of division within me

00:27:32.413 --> 00:27:37.288
or this polarity that was the that's
almost like it's almost like mythic in

00:27:37.288 --> 00:27:40.954
it's you know, when I think about it
and I interpret it this way is like

00:27:41.163 --> 00:27:47.038
the mother, the good mother who's been
taken from me and the and the bad father.

00:27:47.038 --> 00:27:50.204
The dark father who abandoned me.

00:27:50.871 --> 00:27:55.288
You know, if I can't be the woman my
mother raised me to be that ambitious,

00:27:55.871 --> 00:28:01.454
generous life, you know, light filled
person, maybe I can be the junk,